    <h2 id="d-d-h">Two first places</h2>
    <h3>Wafir · TCS Sustainathon Saudi Arabia 2026</h3>
    <p>An AI digital twin for buildings: it finds which appliances drive the electricity bill and ranks fixes in riyals against the real bill. I built the digital twin. First place and the SAR 15,000 grand prize. The competition drew 250+ registrations and 50+ final submissions from 40+ universities, and 10 teams reached the finals.</p>
