    <h3>FieldLog · TechHub Innovation Startup Challenge</h3>
    <p>A voice-to-ERP platform that lets industrial field auditors log a compliance observation in under 20 seconds, just by speaking. Built on React, Whisper and GPT-4o, and live after 48 hours. First place and a SAR 3,000 prize.</p>
